nd transition-colors\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"text-[0.8rem] text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of Use</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-border/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-[0.72rem] text-muted-foreground/60\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> MediVerse AI. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[0.72rem] text-muted-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block\"></span>All systems operational</span><p class=\"text-[0.72rem] text-muted-foreground/60\">Built by Alok Kumar Sahu</p></div></div></div></footer></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-4 right-4 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse gap-2 p-4 sm:max-w-[390px]\"></ol></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-aa44a63be2da1f40.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/52d14c525d9518af.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/0133390772ac3a63.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8402,[\\\"2809\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2809-99e3ad713fbedc19.js\\\",\\\"1267\\\",\\\"static/chunks/1267-12030931745a4ac7.js\\\",\\\"3464\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3464-f16cdf6cfd3933fe.js\\\",\\\"6137\\\",\\\"static/chunks/6137-de267f975f27b52e.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-f981de8bfa048984.js\\\",\\\"4009\\\",\\\"static/chunks/4009-96da32b730798430.js\\\",\\\"2289\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2289-464b396983799adc.js\\\",\\\"9095\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(public)/privacy/page-6eea6304b80e069c.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[6423,[],\\\"\\\"